<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>隨身祭司介紹｜永翼天堂</title>

<style>
*{
    box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{
    margin:0;
    font-family:"Microsoft JhengHei", Arial, sans-serif;
    background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top, #123b63 0%, #071827 45%, #020812 100%);
    color:#eaf6ff;
    line-height:1.8;
}

.container{
    max-width:1000px;
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:40px 18px 70px;
}

.header{
    text-align:center;
    padding:45px 20px;
    border-radius:22px;
    background:rgba(12,40,70,.72);
    border:1px solid rgba(120,200,255,.35);
    box-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(80,180,255,.18);
    margin-bottom:28px;
}

.logo-title{
    font-size:42px;
    letter-spacing:4px;
    color:#dff7ff;
    text-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(110,210,255,.8);
    margin-bottom:10px;
}

.subtitle{
    font-size:18px;
    color:#aee6ff;
}

.panel{
    background:rgba(5,22,38,.78);
    border:1px solid rgba(100,190,255,.28);
    border-radius:18px;
    padding:24px;
    margin-bottom:24px;
    box-shadow:0 0 24px rgba(50,150,255,.12);
}

.section-title{
    font-size:26px;
    color:#bceeff;
    margin-bottom:14px;
    border-left:5px solid #76d6ff;
    padding-left:12px;
    text-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(90,200,255,.5);
}

.notice{
    color:#d9f6ff;
    font-size:17px;
}

.helper-table{
    width:100%;
    border-collapse:collapse;
    overflow:hidden;
    border-radius:14px;
    margin-top:15px;
}

.helper-table th{
    background:rgba(58,145,210,.75);
    color:#ffffff;
    padding:14px;
    font-size:18px;
    border:1px solid rgba(160,220,255,.35);
}

.helper-table td{
    padding:14px;
    border:1px solid rgba(120,200,255,.25);
    background:rgba(8,35,60,.78);
    color:#eaf8ff;
    font-size:17px;
}

.helper-table tr:nth-child(even) td{
    background:rgba(12,48,78,.82);
}

.level{
    color:#9ee7ff;
    font-weight:bold;
    white-space:nowrap;
}

.skill{
    color:#ffffff;
}

.back-box{
    text-align:center;
    margin-top:30px;
}

.back-btn{
    display:inline-block;
    padding:12px 30px;
    border-radius:999px;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2b8ed6,#6fd6ff);
    color:#001827;
    font-weight:bold;
    text-decoration:none;
    box-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(95,210,255,.45);
}

.back-btn:hover{
    filter:brightness(1.12);
}

.footer{
    text-align:center;
    color:#7fb8d6;
    font-size:14px;
    margin-top:35px;
}

@media(max-width:700px){
    .logo-title{
        font-size:32px;
    }

    .helper-table th,
    .helper-table td{
        font-size:15px;
        padding:10px;
    }

    .level{
        white-space:normal;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <div class="header">
        <div class="logo-title">隨身祭司介紹</div>
        <div class="subtitle">永翼天堂｜專屬輔助系統</div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel">
        <div class="section-title">系統說明</div>
        <div class="notice">
            隨身祭司可協助玩家施放輔助魔法，依照祭司等級不同，可使用的輔助技能也會逐步提升。
            等級越高，輔助能力越完整，讓玩家在練功、打寶、挑戰 Boss 時更加穩定。
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel">
        <div class="section-title">隨身祭司等級與技能</div>

        <table class="helper-table">
            <tr>
                <th>隨身祭司等級</th>
                <th>可施放輔助魔法</th>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td class="level">初級隨身祭司</td>
                <td class="skill">通暢氣脈術、體魄強健術</td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td class="level">中級隨身祭司</td>
                <td class="skill">通暢氣脈術、體魄強健術、大地防護</td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td class="level">高級隨身祭司</td>
                <td class="skill">通暢氣脈術、體魄強健術、鋼鐵防護、靈魂昇華</td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td class="level">頂級隨身祭司</td>
                <td class="skill">通暢氣脈術、體魄強健術、鋼鐵防護、靈魂昇華、聖結界</td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </div>

    <div class="panel">
        <div class="section-title">技能特色</div>
        <div class="notice">
            初級祭司提供基礎能力強化；中級祭司追加防禦輔助；
            高級祭司開始具備完整防護與靈魂昇華；
            頂級祭司則可施放聖結界，是最完整的輔助型隨身祭司。
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="back-box">
        <a class="back-btn" href="index.html">返回官方首頁</a>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        © 永翼天堂 All Rights Reserved.
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
